  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into wedges and place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt.\n• Toss to coat, spread out evenly and bake until tender, 25-30 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61de87418c8f7334ff55cf19/step-f77eb6ac.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, drain and rinse lentils. Grate carrot.\n• In a medium bowl, mash lentils and egg until lentils are broken up.\n• Stir in carrot, plain flour, fine breadcrumbs, vegetable stock, spicy taco seasoning (add less if you’re sensitive to heat!) and a pinch of salt and pepper.\n• Using damp hands, roll mixture into small balls, (you should get 4 per person) then flatten into 1cm-thick patties.\n• Place on a plate and transfer to fridge for 5 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61de87418c8f7334ff55cf19/step-c64af876.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the wedges have 10 mins remaining, heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• When oil is hot, cook patties until golden, 2-4 mins each side. Transfer to plate lined with paper towel.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61de87418c8f7334ff55cf19/step-a663d9e0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato. Cut lime into wedges.\n• In a medium bowl, combine a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Add tomato and mixed salad leaves. Season and toss to coat.\n• Divide patties, fries and salad between plates.\n• Serve with garlic aioli and lime wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61de87418c8f7334ff55cf19/step-2e8cbbd7.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
